{"font_size": 0.4, "font_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_alpha": 0.5, "background_color": "#9C27B0", "Stroke": "none", "type": "AIsubtitle", "lang": "zh", "version": "eng-1.2.0-Index-johns-pen-lite", "body": [{"content": "高维克", "from": 0.04, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 1, "to": 0.96}, {"content": "呃", "from": 0.96, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 2, "to": 1.54}, {"content": "欢迎来到节目", "from": 1.54, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 3, "to": 2.54}, {"content": "先生", "from": 2.54, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 4, "to": 3.0}, {"content": "北约现在计划在格陵兰岛部署军事存在和特朗普", "from": 3.0, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 5, "to": 7.75}, {"content": "援引俄罗斯和中国", "from": 7.75, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 6, "to": 10.27}, {"content": "呃", "from": 10.27, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 7, "to": 10.83}, {"content": "所谓周边的所谓威胁", "from": 10.83, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 8, "to": 13.39}, {"content": "如今丹麦正对美国的扩张发出警报", "from": 13.39, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 9, "to": 17.24}, {"content": "那么此时真正的威胁是谁", "from": 17.24, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 10, "to": 19.74}, {"content": "你认为", "from": 19.74, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 11, "to": 21.04}, {"content": "非常显然真正的威胁", "from": 22.76, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 12, "to": 25.14}, {"content": "而此刻对格陵兰岛唯一的威胁是特朗普及其政府", "from": 25.14, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 13, "to": 30.919}, {"content": "威胁要吞并格陵兰岛", "from": 30.919, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 14, "to": 33.53}, {"content": "掠夺格陵兰岛的资产供美国使用", "from": 33.53, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 15, "to": 38.76}, {"content": "目前格陵兰岛周边根本没有俄军或中国舰船", "from": 38.76, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 16, "to": 44.45}, {"content": "从中国视角", "from": 44.45, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 17, "to": 46.13}, {"content": "毫无任何战略兴趣", "from": 46.13, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 18, "to": 48.85}, {"content": "在地缘政治层面格陵兰岛毫无分析价值", "from": 48.85, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 19, "to": 52.95}, {"content": "因此任何有基本判断力的人都知道是美国", "from": 52.95, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 20, "to": 60.649}, {"content": "在威胁格陵兰岛", "from": 60.649, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 21, "to": 62.649}, {"content": "令人惊讶的是北约秘书长", "from": 62.649, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 22, "to": 66.25}, {"content": "似乎毫无任何战略判断力", "from": 66.25, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 23, "to": 70.94}, {"content": "并非北约秘书长", "from": 70.94, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 24, "to": 74.2}, {"content": "是美国在北约的秘书长", "from": 74.2, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 25, "to": 78.919}, {"content": "我认为我们正面临真正的历史时刻", "from": 78.919, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 26, "to": 82.739}, {"content": "当如此无能者掌管北约这样的大型组织", "from": 82.739, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 27, "to": 90.63}, {"content": "北约正濒临分裂", "from": 90.63, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 28, "to": 93.01}, {"content": "因为某个北约成员国", "from": 93.01, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 29, "to": 94.93}, {"content": "在此特定案例中", "from": 94.93, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 30, "to": 96.37}, {"content": "美国", "from": 96.37, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 31, "to": 97.25}, {"content": "作为最重要北约成员国却要对另一北约成员国发动战争", "from": 97.25, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 32, "to": 102.53}, {"content": "恰好是丹麦", "from": 102.53, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 33, "to": 104.62}, {"content": "这是真相时刻", "from": 104.62, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 34, "to": 107.36}, {"content": "北约秘书长不愿拯救北约", "from": 107.36, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 35, "to": 112.61}, {"content": "却极力将北约推向深渊", "from": 112.61, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 36, "to": 117.38}, {"content": "这正让北约沦为人类笑柄", "from": 117.38, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 37, "to": 122.99}, {"content": "嗯 特朗普宣称将完成格陵兰岛所有计划", "from": 122.99, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 38, "to": 129.09}, {"content": "无论是否愿意", "from": 129.09, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 39, "to": 130.919}, {"content": "包括你", "from": 130.919, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 40, "to": 132.159}, {"content": "S公民", "from": 132.159, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 41, "to": 132.739}, {"content": "中国如何看待这种做法", "from": 132.739, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 42, "to": 135.679}, {"content": "中国坚决反对任何侵略战争行为", "from": 136.75, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 43, "to": 141.32}, {"content": "例如", "from": 141.32, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 44, "to": 142.06}, {"content": "吞并他国或他国领土", "from": 142.06, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 45, "to": 146.35}, {"content": "现在", "from": 146.35, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 46, "to": 146.71}, {"content": "我认为如果特朗普和美国", "from": 146.71, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 47, "to": 148.87}, {"content": "政府胆敢朝危险方向行动", "from": 148.87, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 48, "to": 149.05}, {"content": "必将宣告 Pax Americana 的终结", "from": 149.05, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 49, "to": 151.93}, {"content": "这将真正标志着 Pax Americana 的开始终结", "from": 151.93, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 50, "to": 157.56}, {"content": "因为它将揭示美国的真实面目", "from": 157.56, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 51, "to": 161.38}, {"content": "而美国并不关心安全问题", "from": 161.38, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 52, "to": 164.76}, {"content": "主权", "from": 164.76, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 53, "to": 165.52}, {"content": "他国领土完整", "from": 165.52, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 54, "to": 168.04}, {"content": "它只关心掠夺他国资产与财富", "from": 168.04, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 55, "to": 174.019}, {"content": "甚至不惜侵犯他国主权和领土完整", "from": 174.019, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 56, "to": 180.74}, {"content": "这标志着从所谓巅峰的自由坠落", "from": 180.74, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 57, "to": 186.44}, {"content": "坠入丛林法则的深渊，历史将回望并审判", "from": 186.44, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 58, "to": 192.469}, {"content": "这将是美国历史上非常黑暗的时刻", "from": 192.469, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 59, "to": 196.869}, {"content": "因为它把自己变成了鹦鹉", "from": 196.869, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 60, "to": 199.95}, {"content": "并将自己变为侵略者", "from": 199.95, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 61, "to": 202.69}, {"content": "入侵者并赞扬某个国家", "from": 202.69, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 62, "to": 206.55}, {"content": "该国曾以美国坚定盟友为傲数十年", "from": 206.55, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 63, "to": 212.81}, {"content": "作为北约骄傲成员的丹麦，北京已多次对北约扩张表示关切", "from": 212.81, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 64, "to": 221.92}, {"content": "在亚太地区", "from": 221.92, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 65, "to": 223.3}, {"content": "随着联盟将目光投向北极", "from": 223.3, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 66, "to": 226.2}, {"content": "中国会有什么反应呢", "from": 226.2, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 67, "to": 230.82}, {"content": "中国坚决反对北约扩张", "from": 230.82, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 68, "to": 233.75}, {"content": "尤其是向亚太地区扩张", "from": 233.75, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 69, "to": 236.85}, {"content": "因为中国认为若北约走向危险方向", "from": 236.85, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 70, "to": 241.03}, {"content": "这是对北约组织原始宪章义务的违反", "from": 241.03, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 71, "to": 247.27}, {"content": "但如今北约自身已濒临崩溃", "from": 247.27, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 72, "to": 253.46}, {"content": "在美国威胁入侵格陵兰岛的压力下", "from": 253.46, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 73, "to": 258.83}, {"content": "无视丹麦的主权和领土完整", "from": 258.83, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 74, "to": 263.53}, {"content": "我认为这是真相时刻", "from": 263.53, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 75, "to": 265.81}, {"content": "我们必须密切关注局势发展", "from": 265.81, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 76, "to": 269.43}, {"content": "我希望人类会呼吁美国", "from": 269.43, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 77, "to": 272.77}, {"content": "不要对骄傲的国家采取侵略行动", "from": 272.77, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 78, "to": 277.09}, {"content": "比如丹麦", "from": 277.09, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 79, "to": 278.51}, {"content": "在这一点上", "from": 278.51, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 80, "to": 280.05}, {"content": "我完全站在丹麦人民和政府一边", "from": 280.05, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 81, "to": 286.71}, {"content": "任何人都不应允许美国对丹麦发动侵略", "from": 286.71, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 82, "to": 292.919}, {"content": "并看到格陵兰岛", "from": 292.919, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 83, "to": 295.06}, {"content": "我了解格陵兰岛约五万人", "from": 295.06, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 84, "to": 299.94}, {"content": "反对美国任何形式的侵略行动", "from": 299.94, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 85, "to": 303.78}, {"content": "夺取格陵兰岛", "from": 303.78, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 86, "to": 305.3}, {"content": "他们希望自主决定命运", "from": 305.3, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 87, "to": 308.04}, {"content": "对被美国吞并毫无兴趣", "from": 308.04, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 88, "to": 312.64}, {"content": "这是特朗普政府真正展现", "from": 312.64, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 89, "to": 317.34}, {"content": "尊重格陵兰岛和丹麦人民的意愿", "from": 321.6, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 90, "to": 328.64}, {"content": "好的", "from": 328.92, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 91, "to": 329.54}, {"content": "高伟", "from": 334.42, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 92, "to": 335.12}, {"content": "非常感谢您的分析", "from": 335.12, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 93, "to": 337.16}]}